---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Terms & Conditions | ApprovedTilers.co.uk" description="Terms and conditions for using our platform.">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 prose prose-slate">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">Terms & Conditions</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-8">Last Updated: October 2026</p>
    
    <h3>1. Our Platform</h3>
    <p>ApprovedTilers.co.uk connects homeowners with verified, independent tiling contractors. All contractors in our network carry a minimum of £2,000,000 public liability insurance.</p>
    
    <h3>2. Fixed Price Guarantee</h3>
    <p>Quotes provided after the initial home survey are 100% fixed. No rogue extras will be charged unless the scope of work is explicitly changed by the homeowner after commencement.</p>
    
    <h3>3. 12-Month Workmanship Warranty</h3>
    <p>All work carried out by our approved tilers is backed by a 12-month workmanship guarantee against defects in installation (e.g., loose tiles, failing grout). This does not cover structural movement of the property.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
